(
    title: "Thunderground",
    developer: Some("Jeff Lorenz"),
    description: Some("Tunnel a capsule up through the earth toward six nuclear bases, each sitting behind a force field you must chew away before your laser can reach it. White sentry tanks can only follow existing tunnels while blue diggers carve their own — and a patient player lets those diggers strip the force field for them, while a third tank advances on your reserves as a clock."),
